class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-inter)]\" lang=\"en\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-gray-800 bg-gray-900/95 backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4\"><div class=\"flex h-16 items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-purple-500\" href=\"/en\">WhatView</a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-6 md:flex\"><a class=\"text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-purple-400 text-gray-300\" href=\"/en\">Home</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-purple-400 text-gray-300\" href=\"/en/movies\">Movies</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-purple-400 text-gray-300\" href=\"/en/dramas\">TV Shows</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-purple-400 text-gray-300\" href=\"/en/trending\">Trending</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-purple-400 text-gray-300\" href=\"/en/new-releases\">New</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-purple-400 text-gray-300\" href=\"/en/search\">Search</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><select class=\"bg-gray-800 text-white text-sm rounded px-2 py-1 border border-gray-700 focus:outline-none focus:border-purple-500\" aria-label=\"Language\"><option value=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"en\" selected=\"\">English</option><option value=\"ja\">日本語</option></select><button class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-800 md:hidden\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></header><main class=\"min-h-screen\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12\"><h1 class=\"mb-8 text-3xl font-bold\">Privacy Policy</h1><div class=\"space-y-8 text-gray-300\"><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white\">1. Purpose of Processing Personal Information</h2><p>WhatView (hereinafter referred to as the &quot;Service&quot;) processes personal information for the following purposes.</p><ul class=\"mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\"><li>Service provision and operation</li><li>Service usage statistics and analysis</li><li>Service improvement and new service development</li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white\">2. Personal Information Collected</h2><p>This Service is available without registration. We do not collect personal information separately.</p><ul class=\"mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\"><li>IP address</li><li>Cookies</li><li>Visit date and time</li><li>Service usage records</li><li>Device information (browser type, OS, etc.)</li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white\">3. Retention Period of Personal Information</h2><p>Automatically collected information is used only for service usage statistics analysis and is immediately deleted after analysis.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white\">4. Use of Cookies</h2><p>This Service uses cookies to provide better service to users.</p><ul class=\"mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\"><li>What are cookies: Small text files sent to your browser by websites</li><li>Purpose: To analyze access frequency and visit times to improve the service</li><li>Cookie rejection: You can refuse to store cookies through browser settings</li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white\">5. Advertising Services</h2><p>This Service may display advertisements through Google AdSense.<a href=\"https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ml-1 text-purple-400 hover:underline\">Google Ads Policy</a></p></section><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white\">6. Privacy Officer</h2><p>If you have any questions about personal information during service use, please contact us below.</p><ul class=\"mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\"><li>Service: WhatView</li><li>Email: privacy@whatview.com</li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white\">7. Changes to Privacy Policy</h2><p>This Privacy Policy is effective from January 25, 2026.</p></section></div><div class=\"mt-12 text-sm text-gray-500\"><p>Effective Date: January 25, 2026</p></div></div></main><footer class=\"border-t border-gray-800 py-8 text-center text-sm text-gray-500\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex justify-center gap-6\"><a href=\"/en/privacy\" class=\"hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors\">Privacy Policy</a><a href=\"/en/terms\" class=\"hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors\">Terms of Service</a></div><div class=\"mb-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 px-4 text-xs text-gray-600\"><span>This product uses the<!-- --> <a href=\"https://www.themoviedb.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:text-gray-400\">TMDB API</a> <!-- -->but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.</span><span>YouTube content provided via<!-- --> <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/youtube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:text-gray-400\">YouTube API Services</a></span></div><p>© 2026 WhatView. All rights reserved.</p></footer></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-47d3562330c199b2.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[5244,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[3866,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[3704,[\\\"177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-2ed7aef6c802199d.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[7033,[],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n7:I[1503,[\\\"497\\\",\\\"static/chunks/497-41a75ad3be4ad400.js\\\",\\\"810\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/%5Blocale%5D/privacy/page-9025f99bfc525c45.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\na:I[6213,[],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[6213,[],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[6213,[],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]